  triage:snippet "LOGGER.info(\"graft_recovery_counts unread=%s pending_ack=%s\", ...) — logged unconditionally; zero-work case (both counts zero) shares the same event name as the summary-emitted case instead of a distinct name like graft_recovery_no_work." ;
  triage:status "fixed" ;
